Subject: [PATCH] arm64: apple: add isolated J714s GPU trial and device voltage
 bins

Local AI-assisted adaptation of Aurora PR1173 at 34f2f5bb4d03bbe3acce237cb67af8dc9972aa4a, after the omarchy-m5 sixteen-patch Aurora baseline. No upstream authorship or hardware verification is claimed.

Use the saved J714s runtime ADT e68662cd086179dd7fdebdd3046eec4fbf27aa287b266a7e0a550434a8ad2017 for main and auxiliary voltage tables. Main entries encode u32 Hz/mV; auxiliary entries encode u64 microvolts/Hz. Keep upstream J716s selection intact and preserve ID-derived topology checks. Do not install unmeasured leakage-controller calibration.

Keep the working board DT included unchanged. All firmware reservations and native mailbox resources start disabled and are filled only by the matching fail-closed m1n1 GPU handoff. No live hardware access, builds or tests were performed while authoring this patch.
